cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use SC-Geom or part of it, or research methods implemented in it,
  please cite the software using the metadata in this file.
  When using algorithms associated with specific publications, please also cite
  the corresponding publication listed in the module documentation or references.

title: "SC-Geom: SoulCrafted Geometry and Numerical Methods Subsystem"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Siadatnejad"
    given-names: "Sohail"
    alias: "Sohail Siadat"
    affiliation: "EntoMind Ltd"

abstract: >
  SC-Geom is the advanced geometry and numerical-computation subsystem of the SoulCrafted Slicer.
  It provides research-oriented and production geometry functionality including
  support-structure generation, mesh analysis, remeshing, physically-aware slicing,
  printing quality optimisation, numerical field methods, diagnostics,
  and related operations.

repository-code: "https://codeberg.org/SoulCrafted/Slicer"

url: "https://entomind.com/geom/sc-geom"

version: "0.1.0"
# provisional:
date-released: "2026-09-14"

license: "GPL-3.0-only"
